<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS4.SSS0.Px2" title="In B.4 Centered Kernel Alignmen ‣ Appendix B Training and Evaluation Details ‣ RL’s Razor: Why Online Reinforcement Learning Forgets Less" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">CKA with <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math>-NN Alignment (CKNNA) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<span class="ltx_ref">Huh et al., 2024</span>)</cite></span></a></li>
